{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54011","headline":"颂 · 从谂","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渠说佛有难，我说渠有灾。\n但看我避难，何处有相随？\n有无不是说，去来非去来。\n爲你说难法，对面识得来。\n（以上十六首均见宋渭颐藏主《古尊宿语录》卷十四《赵州真际禅师语录》卷下）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}